{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ %@ supplied" : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home, My Holdings' Earn tab, under a position: how much is lent. The values are an amount (1,250.5), then the asset's code (XLM), never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@ supplied"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@ depositados"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@ fournis"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ %2$@ 공급 중"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已存入 %1$@ %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ APY" : {
      "comment" : "[tight] Stellar Home, My Holdings' Earn tab: a chip with the yearly rate a position earns. %@ is a percentage (3.10%). APY: annual percentage yield",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ APY"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ APY"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "연 %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "年化 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Closed" : {
      "comment" : "[tight] Stellar Home, My Holdings' Moments tab: the Moment's collecting window has closed or it sold out, so no more editions can be collected (an adjective)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cerrado"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fermé"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "종료"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Collect a Moment on the Moments tab and your editions appear here." : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home, My Holdings' Moments tab when the account holds no edition: how to get one",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Colecciona un Moment en la pestaña Moments y tus ediciones aparecerán aquí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Collectez un Moment dans l'onglet Moments et vos éditions apparaîtront ici."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Moments 탭에서 Moment를 수집하면 내 에디션이 여기에 표시돼요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Moments 标签页收藏 Moment 后，你的份数会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dollar values use mainnet market prices. Testnet assets have no value." : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home, under the balance card on Stellar's test network: the dollar figures value test XLM and USDC at the real (mainnet) market's prices, though test assets are worth nothing",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los valores en dólares usan precios de mercado de mainnet. Los activos de testnet no tienen valor."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les valeurs en dollars utilisent les prix du marché du mainnet. Les actifs du testnet n'ont aucune valeur."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "달러 가치는 메인넷 시장 가격을 사용해요. 테스트넷 자산은 가치가 없어요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "美元价值采用主网市场价格。测试网资产没有价值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DyorHQ pays this first swap's network fee." : {
      "comment" : "Under the starter swap's button on Stellar Home: DyorHQ pays the network fee of the account's first swap into XLM; every later one the user pays. DyorHQ is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ paga la comisión de red de este primer intercambio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ paie les frais de réseau de ce premier échange."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 첫 스왑의 네트워크 수수료는 DyorHQ가 내요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ 支付这首次兑换的网络费。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earned" : {
      "comment" : "[tight] Stellar Home, My Holdings' Earn tab: under the interest a position has earned so far, in dollars",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ganado"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gagné"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "수익"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已赚取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every Stellar transaction pays a small network fee in XLM. Send about %@ XLM to your account." : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home, the add-funds card for an account short of XLM. %@ is an amount of XLM (1). XLM and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada transacción en Stellar paga una pequeña comisión de red en XLM. Envía unos %@ XLM a tu cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chaque transaction Stellar paie de petits frais de réseau en XLM. Envoyez environ %@ XLM sur votre compte."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "모든 Stellar 트랜잭션에는 XLM으로 내는 소액의 네트워크 수수료가 들어요. 계정에 약 %@ XLM을 보내세요."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每笔 Stellar 交易都需要支付少量 XLM 作为网络费。向你的账户发送约 %@ XLM。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fund with Friendbot" : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home on the test network: claims Stellar's Friendbot faucet's free test XLM for the account, once per address. Friendbot is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fondear con Friendbot"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Financer avec Friendbot"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Friendbot으로 충전"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用 Friendbot 充值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get %@ free test XLM, once" : {
      "comment" : "Under Fund with Friendbot on Stellar Home: what the one claim gives. %@ is an amount of XLM (10,000). XLM is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recibe %@ XLM de prueba gratis, una sola vez"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Recevez %@ XLM de test gratuits, une seule fois"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "무료 테스트 XLM %@개를 한 번 받아요"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费领取 %@ 个测试 XLM，仅限一次"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get XLM for network fees" : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home, the add-funds card's title for an account that holds other assets but too little XLM: every Stellar transaction pays a small network fee in XLM. XLM is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Consigue XLM para las comisiones de red"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Obtenez des XLM pour les frais de réseau"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "네트워크 수수료용 XLM 받기"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "获取用于网络费的 XLM"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Markets couldn't be loaded just now." : {
      "comment" : "Stellar Home, Top Tokens: Stellar's markets couldn't be read. A Retry button follows. Stellar is never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No se pudieron cargar los mercados en este momento."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Impossible de charger les marchés pour le moment."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "지금은 마켓을 불러올 수 없습니다."
